Date:   Mon Jun 1 18:36:03 2026 +0000

    [GB10][ModelLoader] Honor weight_loader_drop_cache_after_load on the fastsafetensors path
    
    fastsafetensors_weights_iterator silently ignored --weight-loader-drop-cache-after-load:
    the drop_cache_after_load param + posix_fadvise(DONTNEED) call existed only on the
    safetensors / multi-thread iterators. Thread the param through and fadvise each shard
    after copy_files_to_device, matching the sibling iterators. Off by default; no behavior
    change unless the flag is set.
    
    Note: this does NOT change KV-pool sizing on integrated GPUs -- get_available_gpu_memory
    reads MemAvailable, which already counts reclaimable page cache as available (verified).

